{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\MusicStats\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "route-unreferenced",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "GET /index.php/apps/musicstats/s/{token}  musicstats.sharepublic.page  lib/Controller/SharePublicController.php:69",
        "GET /index.php/apps/musicstats/s/{token}/image/{kind}/{id}  musicstats.sharepublic.image  lib/Controller/SharePublicController.php:85"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 2 routes outside OCS. Looked for: a route name or a path in the PHP source and the templates, in 2 files of the frontend source and in the navigation of info.xml. The frontend puts the path of the app and the rest of a URL together at run time, so every text there that reads like a path below the app counted as a call. A route stays behind when the frontend stops calling it. A route that only a client outside the app calls shows here as well, unless its method allows requests from other origins (CORS).",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/musicstats/s/{token}  musicstats.sharepublic.page  lib/Controller/SharePublicController.php:69",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/musicstats/s/{token}/image/{kind}/{id}  musicstats.sharepublic.image  lib/Controller/SharePublicController.php:85"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/BackgroundJob/SnapshotJob.php:43 OCP\\IConfig::getAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly",
        "lib/Db/MusicRepository.php:42 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isInstalled(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; Use either self::isEnabledForUser or self::isEnabledForAnyone",
        "lib/Service/Periode.php:27 OCP\\IConfig::getUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "3 uses in 3 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 34 to 36. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/BackgroundJob/SnapshotJob.php:43 OCP\\IConfig::getAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly",
        "  lib/Db/MusicRepository.php:42 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isInstalled(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; Use either self::isEnabledForUser or self::isEnabledForAnyone",
        "  lib/Service/Periode.php:27 OCP\\IConfig::getUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "template-inline-style",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "templates/share.php:112 style= attribute",
        "templates/share.php:113 style= attribute"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 inline styles in templates/. The default Content Security Policy of the server allows inline style; a response whose policy disallows it drops them. A stylesheet added with OCP\\Util::addStyle() holds in both cases.",
        "  templates/share.php:112 style= attribute",
        "  templates/share.php:113 style= attribute"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/SnapshotService.php:64"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 transaction is opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Service/SnapshotService.php:64"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/StatsService.php:460 time()",
        "lib/Service/StatsService.php:461 time()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 2 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Service/StatsService.php:460 time()",
        "  lib/Service/StatsService.php:461 time()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config-without-lexicon",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/BackgroundJob/SnapshotJob.php:43 getAppValue()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The app reads and writes its app config in 1 place and registers no config lexicon, which IRegistrationContext::registerConfigLexicon() takes since Nextcloud 31. A lexicon states the type, the default and the sensitivity of each key in one place.",
        "  lib/BackgroundJob/SnapshotJob.php:43 getAppValue()"
      ]
    },
